{"title":"Career Roadmap: Information Science & Engineering (ISE) → Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyzes and visualizes data to help organizations understand performance and make informed decisions.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Information Science & Engineering (ISE)"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Domain","text":"Data Analytics, Business Intelligence & Decision Support"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyzes and visualizes data to help organizations understand performance and make informed decisions."},{"type":"p","text":"An ISE graduate has a strong foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programming"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Computer systems"},{"text":"Data management"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Information technology"},{"text":"The ideal Data Analyst profile combines these technical foundations with business understanding and communication."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Collect and extract data"},{"text":"Write SQL queries"},{"text":"Clean and transform datasets"},{"text":"Perform exploratory data analysis"},{"text":"Calculate business KPIs"},{"text":"Identify trends and anomalies"},{"text":"Build dashboards"},{"text":"Generate recurring reports"},{"text":"Perform statistical analysis"},{"text":"Support business decisions"},{"text":"Communicate insights to stakeholders"},{"text":"Automate repetitive analytical tasks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Data Analyst Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Question","Define KPI / Objective","Identify Data Sources","SQL / Data Extraction","Data Cleaning","Exploratory Analysis","Statistical Analysis","Visualization","Insight Generation","Recommendation","Business Decision"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1–2"},{"text":"Analytics Learner / Data Intern"}],[{"text":"Year 2–3"},{"text":"Data Analytics Intern"}],[{"text":"Year 3–4"},{"text":"Data Analyst Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 Years"},{"text":"Junior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 Years"},{"text":"Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"5–8 Years"},{"text":"Senior Data Analyst"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Analytics Lead / Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"12+ Years"},{"text":"Head of Analytics / Analytics Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 1 – Programming & Quantitative Foundation","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Python as the primary analytics programming language."},{"type":"h","text":"Python Fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Data types"},{"text":"Conditions"},{"text":"Loops"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Lists"},{"text":"Tuples"},{"text":"Dictionaries"},{"text":"Sets"},{"text":"File handling"},{"text":"Exception handling"},{"text":"Basic OOP"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Libraries"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"},{"text":"Seaborn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Later add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"Scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"Build foundations in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algebra"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Basic calculus"},{"text":"Linear algebra fundamentals"},{"text":"The most important mathematical area for a Data Analyst is statistics."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2 – Excel & Spreadsheet Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel remains highly useful in analytics environments."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Formulas"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Lookup functions"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"Pivot charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Basic Power Pivot"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"What-if analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Excel Goal"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should be able to take a raw business dataset and produce a clean analytical report without relying entirely on Python."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 – SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL should become one of the student's strongest technical skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"Fundamentals"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"DISTINCT"},{"text":"CASE"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Intermediate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"INNER JOIN"},{"text":"LEFT JOIN"},{"text":"RIGHT JOIN"},{"text":"FULL JOIN"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Aggregate functions"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"String functions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Ranking"},{"text":"Running totals"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Common table expressions"},{"text":"Query optimization fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Question","Identify Tables","Write SQL Query","Join Data","Aggregate","Validate Results","Analyze"]}]},{"heading":"Databases & Data Modeling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand relational database fundamentals."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PostgreSQL"},{"text":"MySQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Rows"},{"text":"Columns"},{"text":"Primary keys"},{"text":"Foreign keys"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Normalization"},{"text":"Indexes"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Views"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Modeling"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fact tables"},{"text":"Dimension tables"},{"text":"Star schema"},{"text":"Snowflake schema"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"This becomes especially useful when working with BI tools."}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2–3 – Data Cleaning & Exploratory Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A large portion of real-world analytics involves making imperfect data usable."},{"type":"h","text":"Data Cleaning"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing values"},{"text":"Duplicate records"},{"text":"Incorrect data types"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Inconsistent categories"},{"text":"Invalid dates"},{"text":"Formatting problems"},{"text":"Incorrect joins"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Pandas"},{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"read_csv"},{"text":"read_excel"},{"text":"Filtering"},{"text":"Grouping"},{"text":"Merging"},{"text":"Aggregation"},{"text":"Reshaping"},{"text":"Missing-value handling"},{"text":"Datetime operations"}]}]},{"heading":"Exploratory Data Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to investigate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributions"},{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Correlations"},{"text":"Outliers"},{"text":"Segments"},{"text":"Seasonality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"EDA Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Dataset","Data Quality Check","Cleaning","Descriptive Statistics","Univariate Analysis","Bivariate Analysis","Segmentation","Trend Analysis","Business Findings"]}]},{"heading":"Year 2–3 – Statistics for Data Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Descriptive Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Mode"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Quartiles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inferential Statistics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Population vs sample"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"p-values"},{"text":"Statistical significance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relationships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Covariance"},{"text":"Regression"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experimentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Control groups"},{"text":"Treatment groups"},{"text":"Experiment design"},{"text":"Conversion metrics"},{"text":"Statistical interpretation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 – Business Intelligence","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Choose one major BI platform."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended"},{"type":"p","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Also useful:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tableau"},{"text":"Looker / Looker Studio"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Data modeling"},{"text":"Relationships"},{"text":"Measures"},{"text":"DAX"},{"text":"Calculated columns"},{"text":"Filters"},{"text":"Slicers"},{"text":"Drill-through"},{"text":"Dashboard design"},{"text":"KPI cards"},{"text":"Interactive reports"}]},{"type":"h","text":"BI Workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data Source","Power Query","Data Cleaning","Data Model","DAX Measures","Visualizations","Dashboard","Business Insights"]}]},{"heading":"Data Visualization & Storytelling","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A good analyst does not simply produce charts."},{"type":"p","text":"They answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"What happened? Why did it happen? What should we do?"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chart selection"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Dashboard hierarchy"},{"text":"Color discipline"},{"text":"Data labeling"},{"text":"Executive reporting"},{"text":"Insight writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Weak insight:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Sales decreased in Q3.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Better analytical insight:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Q3 sales declined primarily because the highest-value customer segment experienced lower repeat purchases, while new-customer acquisition remained stable.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Then connect the finding to an actionable recommendation."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 – Advanced Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn enough analytics to move beyond descriptive reporting."},{"type":"h","text":"Predictive Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Linear regression"},{"text":"Logistic regression"},{"text":"Decision trees"},{"text":"Random forests"},{"text":"Gradient boosting concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clustering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"K-means"},{"text":"Hierarchical clustering"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trends"},{"text":"Seasonality"},{"text":"Moving averages"},{"text":"Forecasting fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not necessarily to become a Data Scientist, but to know when predictive techniques are appropriate and how to interpret their results."}]},{"heading":"Business Domain Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with major business functions."},{"type":"h","text":"Sales Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Sales growth"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Average order value"},{"text":"Sales pipeline"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Marketing Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Campaign performance"},{"text":"ROI"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Segmentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Margin"},{"text":"Budget vs actual"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Productivity"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"Capacity"},{"text":"Operational efficiency"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 – Analytics Automation & Cloud","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to automate repetitive analytical workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Python Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Automated reporting"},{"text":"Data extraction"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"File processing"},{"text":"Scheduled reports"},{"text":"API data collection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"APIs"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"REST APIs"},{"text":"JSON"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"API requests"},{"text":"Pagination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cloud Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn one cloud ecosystem:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AWS"},{"text":"Azure"},{"text":"Google Cloud"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Object storage"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Compute"},{"text":"IAM"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Advanced cloud knowledge is not mandatory for an entry-level Data Analyst, but it becomes increasingly useful in larger organizations."}]}]},{"heading":"Data Warehousing & Modern Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Operational Database","ETL / ELT","Data Warehouse","BI Tool","Dashboard","Business Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ETL"},{"text":"ELT"},{"text":"Data pipelines"},{"text":"Data warehouses"},{"text":"Data lakes"},{"text":"Data marts"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Data governance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful technologies to become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Snowflake"},{"text":"BigQuery"},{"text":"Databricks"},{"text":"Redshift"},{"text":"Azure Synapse"},{"text":"Mastering all of them is unnecessary at the undergraduate level."}]}]},{"heading":"Final-Year Project Ideas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Project 1","text":"Sales Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an end-to-end sales analytics system."},{"type":"h","text":"Analyze"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Profit"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Regions"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Sales representatives"},{"text":"Monthly trends"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Deliverables"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL analysis"},{"text":"Python EDA"},{"text":"Power BI dashboard"},{"text":"Executive insights"},{"text":"Business recommendations"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Project 2","text":"Customer Churn Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze why customers leave a service."},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Data","SQL Analysis","Customer Segmentation","Churn Analysis","Risk Factors","Dashboard","Retention Recommendations"]},{"type":"p","text":"Optional extension:"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a basic churn prediction model."},{"type":"note","label":"Project 3","text":"E-Commerce Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Orders"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Products"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Discounts"},{"text":"Returns"},{"text":"Geography"},{"text":"Build an executive dashboard and identify opportunities to increase profitability."}]},{"type":"note","label":"Project 4","text":"HR Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee turnover"},{"text":"Department performance"},{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Hiring"},{"text":"Tenure"},{"text":"Build an HR analytics dashboard with recommendations."}]},{"type":"note","label":"Project 5","text":"Marketing