":"p","text":"Certifications should support practical ability rather than replace it."},{"type":"p","text":"A candidate with:"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","Excel","Power BI","Python","statistics","strong projects"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"will generally have a more useful entry-level portfolio than someone with many certificates but little hands-on analysis."}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Tech Data Science"},{"text":"M.Tech Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"M.Tech Computer Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"M.Sc Statistics"},{"text":"M.S. Data Analytics"},{"text":"M.S. Business Analytics"},{"text":"M.S. Computer Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"MBA Operations"},{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"MBA General Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a standard Data Analyst career, PG is optional. It becomes more valuable when targeting advanced analytics, management or specialized quantitative roles."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"KPIs"},{"text":"Data modeling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Product Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User behavior"},{"text":"Product engagement"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Experiments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Marketing Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign performance"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"ROI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Financial Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Profitability"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. 