s to validate AI-generated queries, calculations and conclusions."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DATA ANALYST"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"┌───────────────────┼───────────────────┐"},{"text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"text":"Data Analytics Business"},{"text":"│ │ │"},{"text":"SQL Statistics KPIs"},{"text":"Excel EDA Finance"},{"text":"Python Forecasting Marketing"},{"text":"Pandas A/B Tests Operations"},{"text":"│ │ │"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["└───────────────────┼───────────────────┘","Visualization"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"flow","items":["Power BI / Tableau","Data Modeling"]},{"type":"p","text":"│"},{"type":"flow","items":["Warehousing / ETL","AI Tools"]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong ISE graduate targeting Data Analyst roles should be able to independently complete an analytics assignment from raw data to business recommendation."},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced SQL"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Strong Python"},{"text":"Pandas/NumPy"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau"},{"text":"Data modeling"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"EDA"},{"text":"Basic ML"},{"text":"Forecasting fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Revenue analysis"},{"text":"Customer analytics"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Operations analytics"},{"text":"Profitability analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dashboard storytelling"},{"text":"Executive summaries"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Insight writing"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should graduate with:"},{"type":"h","text":"3–5 analytics projects"},{"type":"h","text":"2 strong BI dashboards"},{"type":"h","text":"1 SQL-heavy project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 Python analytics project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 predictive analytics project"},{"type":"h","text":"1 relevant internship"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GitHub portfolio"},{"text":"Documented business recommendations"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning for this degree-to-career pathway is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analyst with strong SQL, Excel, Python, statistics and Power BI skills, capable of transforming raw business data into reliable insights, dashboards and actionable recommendations."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / B.E. Information Science & Engineering","Python + Excel","SQL + DBMS","Statistics","Pandas + EDA","Power BI + Data Visualization","Data Modeling + DAX","Business Analytics","Forecasting + Basic ML","Analytics Internship","Junior Data Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead / Manager"]},{"type":"note","label":"Core priority","text":"For an ISE student targeting Data Analyst roles, the strongest employability combination is SQL + Excel + Power BI + Python + statistics + business understanding. Advanced AI/ML should be treated as an additional capability rather than the core requirement for the entry-level role."}]}]}